	(descr "TI LP5912-3.3DRVR WSON-6 (DRV). Land per ${OPENDRONE_LIB}/datasheet/LP5912.pdf p35-37 DRV0006A (4222173/C): body 2.0 x 2.0, EP 1.0 x 1.6; land example 6X (0.45) x 6X (0.3), 4X (0.65), (1.95) row centres, EP (1) x (1.6), (R0.05); stencil: EP 2 windows (1.0 x 0.7) at (0.45), 88 % printed coverage; pin 1 top-left. EP drawn square-cornered so the TI stencil windows (1.0 x 0.7, 87.5 %, ratio_max raised to 0.90 accordingly) stay inside the copper; EP vias are placed on the board (P5), as for the other lib footprints. Corrected copy of OpenDrone:WSON-6-1EP_2x2mm_P0.65mm_EP1x1.6mm (same frame), F.Fab body, no component silk; spec hardware/tools/land_specs/WSON-6-1EP_2x2mm_P0.65mm_EP1x1.6mm_W.json")
